WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:33.290
I pursued Bakura into the city.

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:37.210
His Diabound attacked the city.

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:38.880
That's cheating!

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:43.710
I won't allow you to attack the innocent!

00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:50.110
Since Diabound can hide in the shadows, I don't know where it'll attack from.

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:52.090
If nothing changes...

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:59.800
Time Rewinds

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:02.300
Pharaoh, are you okay?

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:03.230
Yes.

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:05.640
The priests…

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:06.680
Diabound!

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:08.060
Wait!

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:14.240
It vanished.

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:19.330
Stay alert!  Diabound attacks from the shadows!

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:21.330
Cavalry!  Pursue Bakura!

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:25.350
City guard!  Evacuate the civilians to the palace courtyard!

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:33.390
Go to the courtyard!

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:34.770
Hurry!

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:38.610
Where did they go?

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:41.280
Over there!

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:47.120
We can't see our foe, but don't be scared!

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:48.580
Go, Duos!

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:50.580
Helimai!

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:57.620
Bakura, I will defeat you!

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:00.620
Go ahead and try.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:04.430
Dodge!

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:11.650
Karim!

00:03:12.010 --> 00:03:14.440
Toughen up, Karim!

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:19.880
If our fighting spirit loses against the shadows, the kingdom will end!

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:22.320
R-Right.  I’m fine.

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:27.450
- Hurry!
- This way!
 - What's taking so long!

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:29.700
This way!  Hurry!

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:33.920
See anything, Isis?

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:38.860
A dark shadow is sneaking up on the sky god.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.870
What?  The sky god?

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:53.110
There must be a way to find the enemy that's hiding in the shadows!

00:03:55.390 --> 00:03:56.290
Pharaoh!

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:58.600
After him, Karim!

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:08.380
Bakura, you won't stop me!

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:11.560
I’ll use all my strength to defeat you!

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:19.590
I'll end you right here.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:22.540
Prepare yourself, Yugi.

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:26.810
Go, Slifer!

00:04:26.810 --> 00:04:28.950
In the name of the Pharaoh!

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:43.360
The moment it attacks, Diabound will reveal itself.

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:45.160
Time to fight, Bakura!

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:50.330
You fool.  I’ve made preparations you know nothing about.

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:05.310
The god is wide open for attack!

00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:10.520
The Pharaoh is using the sky god to draw the enemy out of hiding?

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:15.470
Die alongside your god, Yugi!

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:19.010
Diabound, attack!  Helical Shockwave!

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:21.780
There!  Fire!

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:24.220
Strike back with Thunder Force!

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:53.530
Aknadin!

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:00.710
S-Seto!  Now!

00:06:02.230 --> 00:06:04.670
Duos!  Aura Sword!

00:06:08.580 --> 00:06:10.550
A direct hit!

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:12.490
Is it destroyed?

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:16.410
Are you blind?

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:18.160
Look closer!

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:26.900
Another Ka?  No way!

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:32.840
Your plans can't trick me!

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:35.770
Bakura...

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:40.210
Die, Pharaoh!  The Millennium Puzzle is mine!

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:43.770
Is this the end?

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:46.620
Pharaoh!

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:51.660
My other self!

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:58.370
Partner?

00:06:58.370 --> 00:06:59.970
My other self.

00:06:59.970 --> 00:07:01.040
Are you okay?

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:02.080
Yugi!

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:02.710
Yugi!

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:05.650
Jonouchi, Honda, Anzu.

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:10.580
How can they be here in the world of memories?

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:13.590
Pull yourself together, Pharaoh!

00:07:13.590 --> 00:07:15.520
We’re with you!

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:20.650
I see.  I still had strength left.

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:23.600
I still have my friends!

00:07:28.330 --> 00:07:35.010
Bakura, I'll invite a god to destroy the shadows of madness and slaughter!

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:39.370
Come forth, The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:57.050
The sun during nighttime?

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.050
This light…

00:08:00.050 --> 00:08:03.420
It pierces the dark clouds and dispels the darkness.

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:05.730
Is this the work of the third god?

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:16.200
That's...

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:18.120
The sun god!

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:21.120
The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:29.840
The sun god?  Impossible!

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:34.400
When I destroyed his sky god, Yugi used up all his Ba.

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:39.360
He didn't have the energy to call another god.

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:42.900
Is it because they're here?

00:08:42.900 --> 00:08:46.310
Did the vessel restore Yugi’s power?

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:56.170
I can sense my partner - the other soul within me!

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:07.300
It turned night into day!

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:09.760
That truly is the power of a god!

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:16.120
If there are no shadows, Diabound can't hide!

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:17.630
Now's our chance to destroy it!

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:19.720
I don't think so!

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:23.320
Diabound already has the power of a god!

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:25.720
Take this!  Thunder Force!

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:28.320
What?

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:31.180
Pharaoh!

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:33.260
Go, Duos!

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:34.950
Aura Force!

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:45.690
I use all my Ba to have Aura Force alter Thunder Force's trajectory!

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:52.330
My attack didn't hit the god!

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:54.500
Now, Pharaoh!

00:09:54.930 --> 00:10:00.010
The fire burning in my soul energizes my god's attack!

00:10:00.010 --> 00:10:01.880
Ra attacks!

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:05.360
Go, God Phoenix!

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:44.060
The god's flame is incinerating Bakura.

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:46.480
This is the end, Bakura!

00:10:52.260 --> 00:10:53.800
Victory is ours!

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:57.740
The Pharaoh has restored peace to our land!

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:07.320
That was close.

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:13.110
You restored strength to my soul, partner.

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:16.040
And my friends.

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:18.480
You did it, Yugi!

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:20.960
Thanks to you.

00:11:20.960 --> 00:11:23.980
If you didn't show up, I'd have lost.

00:11:23.980 --> 00:11:27.090
I always told you we’re friends!

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:31.030
Thank you truly, partner.

00:11:31.030 --> 00:11:32.860
My other self.

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:36.480
Don’t forget us either!

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:37.360
That’s right!

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:37.980
Yeah!

00:11:40.410 --> 00:11:45.350
No matter how apart, we’re always together, Yugi!

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:48.520
Everyone's smiling!  That makes Bobasa happy!

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:52.080
This can't be...

00:11:52.910 --> 00:11:57.890
It's over for me?

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.010
What?

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:05.200
An earthquake?

00:12:05.590 --> 00:12:07.370
What’s going on?

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:12.810
No way!  Time is rewinding!

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:17.180
Partner!  Everyone!

00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:26.990
Yugi!

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:30.270
Partner!  Everyone!

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:51.360
Pharaoh!

00:12:57.050 --> 00:12:59.890
What’s going on?

00:12:59.890 --> 00:13:02.600
Why are we back here?

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:09.520
Bakura...

00:13:09.870 --> 00:13:11.350
Yugi!

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:12.970
Ah.

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:15.160
I won’t let you interfere this time!

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:17.240
Attack, Diabound!

00:13:17.240 --> 00:13:18.910
Helical Shockwave!

00:13:27.020 --> 00:13:29.640
Pharaoh!

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:37.280
Bakura!

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:41.190
I’ll take this.

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:44.300
See ya, Pharaoh!

00:13:46.230 --> 00:13:47.310
Yugi!

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:52.900
Yugi!

00:13:52.900 --> 00:13:54.040
My other self!

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:55.980
No!

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:59.420
Loop around and find the Pharaoh!

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:04.450
Bakura!  How dare you!

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:11.720
You want to die too?

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:15.830
Let me go!

00:14:19.970 --> 00:14:22.400
Let Honda go!

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:28.840
You chumps annoy me!

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:30.810
What?

00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:42.840
Run away!  Now!

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:45.780
Hurry!  This way!

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:58.720
Time rewound, as if the heavens answered my pleas for a miracle.

00:15:00.360 --> 00:15:04.900
This game is incredible.

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:22.160
You’re safe.  They’re gone.

00:15:22.620 --> 00:15:24.420
That was close.

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:26.700
That punk Bakura!

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:30.540
Yugi lost the Shadow Game.

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:32.860
Anzu.

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:36.340
A Shadow Game is a life-or-death game.

00:15:36.340 --> 00:15:38.480
That means Yugi is...

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:41.220
Don't worry.  I’m sure he’s alive.

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:45.640
Remember what Shadi said before we came here?

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:48.240
This world is the Pharaoh’s memories.

00:15:48.240 --> 00:15:49.860
Yeah.  So?

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:54.580
We’re still here, and the world hasn’t vanished.

00:15:55.340 --> 00:15:59.520
I see. Yugi’s memories haven’t vanished yet.

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:02.540
Yeah.  So he must still be alive.

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:03.960
Let's find him.

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:07.520
Okay!  Let's not waste any time!

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:08.660
Let’s hurry!

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:09.480
Yeah!

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:12.900
Yugi’s toughened up.

00:16:18.050 --> 00:16:23.500
Isis’s prophecy troubled me, so I went to the Pharaoh's tablet shrine.

00:16:24.820 --> 00:16:28.080
What was Aknadin doing there?

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:36.880
You're awake, Aknadin.

00:16:36.880 --> 00:16:40.040
Shada, how's your search for Ka going?

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:48.170
We found a foreign girl whose Heka was too powerful for my Millennium Key to measure.

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:51.420
Heka that your Millennium Key couldn't measure...

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:56.570
You should rest.

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:58.300
Move!

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:00.830
Aknadin!

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:04.330
You still haven't found the Pharaoh?

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:07.130
No, not yet.

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:10.490
Drain the Nile if you have to!  Find him!

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:14.920
I know the Pharaoh is alive!

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:18.860
Have faith for peace throughout the kingdom!

00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:22.060
See anything, Isis?

00:17:22.510 --> 00:17:26.280
A single ripple on the surface of darkness.

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:29.280
A single ripple will vanish.

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:37.230
But when a second or third ripple overlap, they will swell and cause peril.

00:17:37.230 --> 00:17:40.670
Is this the future of our kingdom?

00:17:40.670 --> 00:17:45.200
Yes.  This prophecy is already in motion.

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:52.110
The peace created by the seven Millennium Items is crumbling?

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:55.050
Due to a single bandit?

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:58.040
Aknadin is acting strange?

00:17:58.040 --> 00:18:04.190
Yes.  When I told him about the foreign girl, he suddenly changed.

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:08.880
Where's the girl?

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:13.800
Aknadin took her to the underground arena.

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:15.530
Aknadin?

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:17.230
The underground arena?

00:18:17.230 --> 00:18:21.900
Yes.  He's been asking for you, Seto.

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:24.330
Come with me.

00:18:41.060 --> 00:18:42.760
What's this?

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:45.040
I’ve been waiting, Seto.

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:48.040
Aknadin!  What is this?

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:51.480
What’s wrong?  You have no time to rest!

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:53.920
Fight if you don't want to die!

00:18:53.920 --> 00:18:57.850
If you don't kill your opponent, you'll die!

00:18:57.850 --> 00:19:00.620
Kill!  Kill!

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:12.240
Have you lost your mind, Aknadin?

00:19:12.240 --> 00:19:16.350
Forcing prisoners to fight is inexcusable!

00:19:16.350 --> 00:19:19.680
Don't just stand there!  End this!

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:21.480
Silence, Seto!

00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:25.100
This is what you wished for!  Look!

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:30.300
His Ka grew?

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:36.640
Seto, the will to live makes Ka more powerful.

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:38.620
The will to live?

00:19:38.620 --> 00:19:43.600
The fear of death.  The desire not to die.

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:48.560
By strengthening those emotions, we can create more powerful Ka.

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:50.730
You’re next to die!

00:19:50.730 --> 00:19:53.720
No!  I don’t want to die!

00:19:55.180 --> 00:20:02.680
Seto, should anything happen to the Pharaoh, the kingdom will perish without his divine protection.

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:07.390
I know!  That’s why we must rescue the Pharaoh!

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:09.050
That's not enough!

00:20:09.050 --> 00:20:14.970
What we need is the Pharaoh's successor when he dies!

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:17.440
A new Pharaoh?

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:22.060
The Pharaoh is the chosen one - able to control the three Gods.

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:27.870
Only someone with a Ka stronger than the three gods can become the new Pharaoh.

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:31.820
Seto, acquire power that's stronger than the gods!

00:20:33.610 --> 00:20:37.180
Aknadin wants me to become the Pharaoh?

00:20:37.180 --> 00:20:42.120
This show's over.  Send the girl into the arena!

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:48.560
You're going to make her fight?

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:55.480
Even Shada's Millennium Key cannot measure her Heka.

00:20:56.260 --> 00:21:01.640
So she may have a very powerful Ka.

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:03.360
Wait!

00:21:03.770 --> 00:21:06.800
This is inexcusable!

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:11.240
Even if it's against your orders, I cannot allow this to happen!

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:14.380
Don't be naive, Seto!

00:21:14.380 --> 00:21:20.430
If you're not willing to betray the gods, you'll never become stronger than the gods!

00:21:20.430 --> 00:21:29.120
Watch her tremble and scream in fear!

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:30.270
Seto…

00:22:01.010 --> 00:22:15.630
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:31.350
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:32.070 --> 00:22:37.190
Without a goal in mind

00:22:38.510 --> 00:22:45.760
We just step towards our dream

00:22:46.150 --> 00:22:51.400
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:51.590 --> 00:22:59.870
Your eye will find it

00:23:00.230 --> 00:23:05.680
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:06.470 --> 00:23:13.820
Will touch your soul

00:23:14.010 --> 00:23:17.080
In a duel

00:23:29.150 --> 00:23:32.430
He defeated Bakura!  ...Or so we thought.

00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:38.540
Time rewound, and Bakura dropped the other Yugi into a canyon.

00:23:38.540 --> 00:23:42.480
Yugi says he's safe because the world of memories still exists.

00:23:42.480 --> 00:23:44.970
But I'm worried if we don't find him soon.

00:23:44.970 --> 00:23:48.250
Huh?  Haven't I seen her before?

00:23:48.250 --> 00:23:51.210
Is that Dark Magician Girl?

00:23:51.210 --> 00:23:53.660
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh:
The Pharaoh Is Alive

00:23:53.660 --> 00:23:55.020
Stay tuned!
